      "post_id": "73644",
      "author_handle": "kristag",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 10 months ago",
      "body": "Sophie seems to have upped her milk intake and has been taking from both breasts each feed for the past 10 days.  I don't have a problem with it but wonder whether I should limit her to one side per feed and see if it will up my milk production?\nI'm not sure that feeding from both permanently is the best way forward.\nAny thoughts?",
