      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 10 months ago",
      "body": "I always did 2 breast feeds but as time went on I wasn't able to pump anymore... so maybe the one side feeding is good if you can still pump milk from the other side if you need it??\nI know i wasn't any help there but congrats on doing so well so far Krista!! 😀",
